WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.871
Organizations need consistent ways to manage security risk.

2
00:00:03.871 --> 00:00:13.121
NIST SP 800-53 was created to provide a structured approach to selecting and implementing security and privacy controls.

3
00:00:13.121 --> 00:00:24.216
Instead of inventing security programs from scratch, organizations can use an established framework to identify safeguards, document responsibilities, and improve governance.

4
00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:27.229
The catalog helps different teams use a common language.

5
00:00:27.229 --> 00:00:35.261
Security leaders, engineers, assessors, system owners, and managers can discuss controls using shared terminology.

6
00:00:35.261 --> 00:00:38.544
SP 800-53 does not make risk disappear.

7
00:00:38.544 --> 00:00:45.947
It gives organizations a disciplined way to reason about risk, choose safeguards, and document how those safeguards are managed.
